		{"id":"f817bbc3a7d18795","type":"text","x":0,"y":-360,"width":2000,"height":170,"text":"# Organization atlas — captured names and affiliations\n\nEach person is placed once by one evidenced affiliation; open the note for all other affiliations. This is not a current reporting structure. Unplaced names are in Context and Unresolved.\n\n[[00 Start Here|Guide]] · [[01 Map Index|All maps]] · [[03 Evidence and Open Questions|Evidence rules]]"},
		{"id":"8d01c266d66bd50a","type":"text","x":2100,"y":-360,"width":1450,"height":170,"text":"**● HUMAN** blue · **◆ INSTITUTION** purple · **■ COMPANY** amber · **▣ LAB / TEAM** green · **◇ CONTEXT** grey\n\n**V** green edges = primary-source checked. **B** amber edges = book report. Full evidence and dates are in the linked notes. Grouping is navigation, not a current org chart."},
		{"id":"4cf1a1852a5448e6","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":350,"height":270,"text":"**■ COMPANY** · book + web\n\n### [[Companies/DeepMind|DeepMind]]\n\nCompany founded 2010; acquired by Google 2014; historical entity distinguished from 2023 Google DeepMind.\n\n[Profile / source](https://deepmind.google/blog/from-unlikely-start-up-to-major-scientific-organisation-entering-our-tenth-year-at-deepmind/)","color":"#E8AD59"},
		{"id":"991c81073867a756","type":"text","x":410,"y":0,"width":350,"height":270,"text":"**● HUMAN** · web extension\n\n### [[People/Adam White|Adam White]]\n\nReinforcement-learning researcher; Sutton doctoral alumnus.\n\n[Profile / source](https://sites.ualberta.ca/~amw8/)","color":"#43A8D1"},
